{"seq":1,"slug":"co2-utilization","title":"CO2 化工与矿化利用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/utilization-policy/co2-utilization","wordCount":1341,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"co2-化工与矿化利用\">CO2 化工与矿化利用</h1><p>CCUS 里的「U」常被当成最性感的部分——既然 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是个麻烦，何不把它变成有用的产品，让减排还能赚钱？这种「变废为宝」的叙事很动人，但也最容易误导。关键要先想清楚一个问题：把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 做成产品，到底封住了多少碳、封了多久？做成几小时就喝掉的碳酸饮料，和做成能锁碳几十年的混凝土骨料，气候意义天差地别。本篇就是要把「利用」这件事的减排账算清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 利用（CCU）按碳被锁住的时长，大致分成两类：<strong>短周期利用</strong>（碳很快又释放回大气，如饮料、尿素、合成燃料燃烧）和<strong>长周期/永久固碳</strong>（碳被锁在产品里长期不出来，如矿化建材）。真正有减排意义的，主要是后者，以及那些用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 替代了化石原料的场景。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[捕集的CO2] --&gt; B{利用方式}&#10;  B --&gt; C[化学转化&lt;br/&gt;合成燃料/化学品]&#10;  B --&gt; D[矿化&lt;br/&gt;碳酸盐建材]&#10;  B --&gt; E[生物利用&lt;br/&gt;微藻/温室]&#10;  B --&gt; F[直接利用&lt;br/&gt;饮料/EOR]&#10;  C --&gt; G{碳锁多久?}&#10;  D --&gt; H[长周期 数十年+]&#10;  E --&gt; I[短周期]&#10;  F --&gt; J[短周期/视EOR核算]&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[捕集的CO2] --&gt; B{利用方式}\n  B --&gt; C[化学转化&lt;br/&gt;合成燃料/化学品]\n  B --&gt; D[矿化&lt;br/&gt;碳酸盐建材]\n  B --&gt; E[生物利用&lt;br/&gt;微藻/温室]\n  B --&gt; F[直接利用&lt;br/&gt;饮料/EOR]\n  C --&gt; G{碳锁多久?}\n  D --&gt; H[长周期 数十年+]\n  E --&gt; I[短周期]\n  F --&gt; J[短周期/视EOR核算]\n  G --&gt; I\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>下表按固碳时长与减排逻辑给主要利用路径分类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>利用路径</th>\n<th>产品</th>\n<th>固碳时长</th>\n<th>减排逻辑</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>矿化骨料/混凝土</td>\n<td>建材</td>\n<td>数十年至永久</td>\n<td>长期固碳 + 替代水泥</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合成燃料（e-fuel）</td>\n<td>甲醇、航煤</td>\n<td>短（燃烧再排）</td>\n<td>仅当替代化石燃料才减排</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>化学品</td>\n<td>聚合物、尿素</td>\n<td>视产品寿命</td>\n<td>替代化石原料</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微藻/温室增产</td>\n<td>生物质、果蔬</td>\n<td>短</td>\n<td>减排有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>食品饮料/干冰</td>\n<td>碳酸饮料</td>\n<td>极短</td>\n<td>几乎不减排</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"利用-减排-先算碳账\">利用 ≠ 减排：先算碳账</h2><p>最该破除的迷思是「只要用了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就等于减排」。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 做成合成燃料听起来很环保，但燃料一烧，碳又回到大气，净效果只是「碳循环用了一次」，并没有把碳从大气里拿走。它真正的价值在于：如果这股 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 替代了原本要从地下开采的化石碳，且制造过程用的是清洁能源，那才算减排。否则——用化石电去把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 转化，很可能排得比省得多。所以评估任何 CCU 路径都必须做全生命周期评价（LCA），把转化过程的能耗排放算进去。这与<a href=\"../foundations/maturity-cost\">技术成熟度与成本</a>里「避免成本要扣掉捕集自身排放」是同一种诚实核算的思路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"矿化-把碳真正变回石头\">矿化：把碳真正变回石头</h2><p>在所有利用路径里，矿化是减排逻辑最干净的一种。它让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与含钙镁的材料反应，生成稳定的碳酸盐固体，碳就此被锁死，原理与<a href=\"../transport-storage/geological-storage\">地质封存</a>里的矿化圈闭一脉相承，只是把反应搬到了地面、做成了产品：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>CaO</mtext><mo>→</mo><msub><mtext>CaCO</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2 + \\text{CaO} \\rightarrow \\text{CaCO}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CaO</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CaCO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>典型应用是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 注入新拌混凝土养护，碳被永久固定在骨料里，还能略微提升强度、减少水泥用量——一举两得。这条路线吸引人之处在于，它处理的恰好是最难减排的建材行业（水泥工艺排放见<a href=\"../foundations/sources-pathways\">碳源与减排路径</a>），且产品有真实市场。挑战是单位混凝土能固的碳量有限，规模要靠海量的建筑需求堆出来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"化学转化与合成燃料\">化学转化与合成燃料</h2><p>用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 加氢可以合成甲醇、合成航空燃料等碳氢化合物，这是「电转液」（power-to-liquid）的核心。它对航空、航运这类难以电气化的领域很有吸引力——这些场景需要高能量密度的液体燃料，而绿氢加捕集的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 能造出「碳中性」燃料（前提是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 来自生物质或 DAC，氢来自绿电）。但经济性是硬伤：既要便宜的绿氢，又要便宜的清洁电，目前成本远高于化石燃料。这条路与<a href=\"../../clean-energy/\">清洁能源</a>里的绿氢话题深度交织，是 CCU 中技术想象空间最大、却也离大规模商用最远的一支。</p>\n<h2 id=\"eor-利用市场里的最大份额与最大争议\">EOR：利用市场里的最大份额与最大争议</h2><p>历史上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 最大的「利用」其实是强化采油（EOR），即把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 注入油田驱出更多石油。它的减排定位充满争议，已在<a href=\"../transport-storage/geological-storage\">地质封存</a>讨论过——封存了一部分碳，却换来更多石油燃烧。把它归入「利用」还是「封存」、算不算减排，全看核算边界，而核算规则由政策制定，这就把话题引向了<a href=\"carbon-market-incentives\">碳市场与激励政策</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[CCU 减排评估] --&gt; B[做全生命周期LCA]&#10;  B --&gt; C{碳锁得久吗?}&#10;  C --&gt;|久 矿化建材| D[真减排]&#10;  C --&gt;|短 燃料饮料| E{替代了化石碳?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是 且用清洁能源| F[有条件减排]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[可能净增排]\">graph TD\n  A[CCU 减排评估] --&gt; B[做全生命周期LCA]\n  B --&gt; C{碳锁得久吗?}\n  C --&gt;|久 矿化建材| D[真减排]\n  C --&gt;|短 燃料饮料| E{替代了化石碳?}\n  E --&gt;|是 且用清洁能源| F[有条件减排]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[可能净增排]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CCU 的减排价值不在「用了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>」本身，而在碳被锁住的时长，以及是否替代了化石碳、是否用清洁能源转化——必须做全生命周期评价。</li>\n<li>按固碳时长分两类：长周期/永久（矿化建材，减排逻辑最干净）与短周期（合成燃料、饮料，仅在替代化石且用清洁能源时才减排）。</li>\n<li>矿化把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 固定进混凝土，与地质封存的矿化圈闭同源，针对最难减排的建材行业且有真实市场。</li>\n<li>合成燃料对航空航运有吸引力，但受制于绿氢与清洁电成本，是想象空间最大、离商用最远的一支。</li>\n<li>EOR 是历史最大利用市场也是最大争议，算不算减排取决于政策定义的核算边界。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CO2 化工与矿化利用","id":"co2-化工与矿化利用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"利用 ≠ 减排：先算碳账","id":"利用-减排-先算碳账"},{"level":2,"text":"矿化：把碳真正变回石头","id":"矿化-把碳真正变回石头"},{"level":2,"text":"化学转化与合成燃料","id":"化学转化与合成燃料"},{"level":2,"text":"EOR：利用市场里的最大份额与最大争议","id":"eor-利用市场里的最大份额与最大争议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"封存安全与监测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/transport-storage/storage-safety-monitoring"},"next":{"title":"碳市场与激励政策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/ccus/utilization-policy/carbon-market-incentives"}}